19.31.050 Parks director.
Responsible Official and Initial Decision-Maker. The parks director is the responsible official for and shall initially decide the following types of applications:
A.	Accepting fees in lieu of parkland;
B.	Acceptable parkland dedications;
C.	All other decisions authorized in Chapter 19.20, Parks and Open Space, to be decided by the parks director.
(Ord. 16882 § 2 (part), 2008)
